        <mxCell id="n_landing" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;align=center;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Landing Page (landing.html / index.html)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 11px; color: #475569;'&gt;• Hosted on Vercel Edge Global CDN&lt;br/&gt;• Hero, Video Demo &amp;amp; Code Inspector Demo&lt;br/&gt;• Action CTA: &lt;b&gt;Get Extension&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;">
