        <mxCell id="n_extractor" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#22C55E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#14532D;align=center;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Sliding Window Context Extractor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 11px; color: #15803D;'&gt;• Captures &lt;b&gt;100–120 lines&lt;/b&gt; around active cursor&lt;br/&gt;• Symmetrical expansion to function/block boundaries&lt;br/&gt;• Debounced typing observer (350ms pause detection)&lt;br/&gt;• Language &amp;amp; runtime syntax auto-detection&lt;/span&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="870" y="340" width="370" height="110" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n_worker" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;align=center;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Background Service Worker (MV3)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 11px; color: #334155;'&gt;• State management (ACTIVE / IDLE / OPTIMIZING)&lt;br/&gt;• Cross-tab message dispatcher &amp;amp; tab router&lt;br/&gt;• chrome.storage.local secure credentials vault&lt;br/&gt;• Coordinates background seeking on dashboard.html&lt;/span&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="340" width="330" height="110" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n_highlight" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#78350F;align=center;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;In-Editor Code Snippet Highlighter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 11px; color: #92400E;'&gt;• Injects non-destructive overlay on exact DOM coordinates&lt;br/&gt;• Targets: Specific line, keyword, variable, or statement block&lt;br/&gt;• Visual amber/rose pulse highlight over bloated code&lt;/span&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="545" width="380" height="110" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n_tooltip" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;align=center;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Interactive Auto-Sync Popover Tooltip&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 11px; color: #1E293B;'&gt;• Connected to offending code line via anchoring line&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Code Badge:&lt;/b&gt; Shows original vs proposed cleaner syntax&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Diagnostic Rationale:&lt;/b&gt; Syntax errors, intention &amp;amp; Big-O drop&lt;br/&gt;• Action Buttons: &lt;b&gt;[✓ Correct / Accept]&lt;/b&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;b&gt;[✕ Wrong / Reject]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="510" y="545" width="450" height="110" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n_accept_act" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#14532D;align=center;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;[✓ Correct / Accept] Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 11px; color: #15803D;'&gt;• Replaces code in-place in editor&lt;br/&gt;• Monaco / CM / Ace native API call&lt;br/&gt;• Emits ACCEPT event to Neon DB&lt;/span&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="1020" y="545" width="270" height="110" as="geometry"/>
