        <mxCell id="n_autosync" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;align=center;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Daily &amp;amp; Working Auto-Sync Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 11px; color: #334155;'&gt;• Background batch synchronization per day / session&lt;br/&gt;• Records accepted vs rejected tooltip interactions&lt;br/&gt;• Aggregates code health metrics &amp;amp; lines reduced&lt;br/&gt;• Fallback offline queue in chrome.storage.local&lt;/span&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="510" y="970" width="340" height="175" as="geometry"/>
